Bundled data (assets/) carries its own licensing, independent of the above:

- Sky panorama: NASA/GSFC Scientific Visualization Studio, "Deep Star Maps
  2020" (SVS 4851) — public domain (NASA media guidelines).
- Bright-star catalog extract: Yale Bright Star Catalogue, 5th revised
  edition (Hoffleit & Warren 1991), distributed by the Harvard-Smithsonian
  Telescope Data Center — freely redistributable astronomical catalog data.

Attribution for both is displayed in-application and recorded in
REFERENCES.md.
